{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"A rainbow colored Eladrin in glitter and costume takes center stage. A small purple dragon sits atop her shoulder. A spotlight follows them. “Greetings faedies, gentlethems, and to all our visitors native to this realm!” Her voice carries throughout the tent with ease, captivating the audience.","created_at":"2021-07-11T01:22:20.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863591006066442260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
