{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852737863170654259","content":"“Whether this is your first time on Illo’fae, or not, you’re in for the show of your lives! We ask you to sit back and allow yourselves to be taken on a magical journey with us!” And with that all manor of beast and performer flood the stage with her, giving the crowd a glimpse of what is to come. Suddenly this stage darkens and empties. A different voice begins to sing.","created_at":"2021-07-11T01:23:35.607000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863591320705433600","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
